# Tables Standard (TECH_STACK)

## Rule
Source of truth: `docs/TECH_STACK.md`. Tables use **@tanstack/react-table** (§7).

All list screens with tables MUST use @tanstack/react-table. Theme (Light/Dark) must apply via CSS variables (theme.css).

## Forbidden
- Custom table renderers (raw HTML table) without explicit architectural decision.
- Hardcoded light background on table containers.
- Ignoring theme variables for dark mode.

## Required
- Use @tanstack/react-table for list screens (Contracts, Orders, Margin, Countries, etc.).
- Grid/table must switch theme when Light/Dark toggle changes (no refresh).
- Page content area: use theme-aware CSS variables (background, foreground, border).

## Reference
- `docs/TECH_STACK.md` §7 — @tanstack/react-table
- `docs/TECH_STACK.md` §6 — theme.css, Tailwind CSS variables
